    "description": "CCNP Enterprise, CCNP Data Center and CCIE Data Center.\n\n## What's inside\n\n- **Cisco CCNP Enterprise** (ENCOR 350-401 V1.2 + ENARSI 300-410) - Enterprise core technologies and advanced routing: architecture, virtualization, assurance and automation. *25 lessons.*\n- **Cisco CCNP Data Center** (DCCOR 350-601 V1.2) - Data center core technologies: fabrics, ACI, compute, storage networking, automation and security. *23 lessons.*\n- **Cisco CCIE Data Center** (CCIE DATA CENTER V3.1 LAB) - Expert-level data center lab topics: L2/L3, ACI, VXLAN EVPN, compute, storage and automation. *23 lessons.*\n\n## How lessons work\n\nEach lesson combines a written explanation with animated diagrams of the process it describes, annotated code and command-line sessions, key terms, and a short *Check your understanding* quiz. Lessons marked *coming soon* are part of the syllabus and are being written."
